{"deck": "trust_and_betrayal", "coverOffset": 1, "cards": [{"quad": 0, "text": ["INEVITABLE MUTUAL BETRAYAL", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 5 | [A] 6 | [F]1", "POWER: Both players reveal", "their hands. The one with", "the lowest value loses", "everything. If tied, you both", "lose.", "We formed an alliance with", "the explicit intent of destroying", "each other. Why are you", "surprised?"], "n": 1, "page": 2}, {"n": 2, "quad": 1, "text": ["IN THE BACK", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 2 | [F] 0", "POWER: Play only when", "an opponent leaves the", "room. Steal their best", "card.", "Cowards live longer.", "BLÖDSINN!", "It's simple biology."], "page": 2}, {"page": 2, "n": 3, "quad": 2, "text": ["THE OATH-BREAKER", "Permanent Maughter", "[R] 6 | [A] 3 | [F] 2", "POWER: Cancel any \"Promise\"", "or \"Alliance\" made in the", "last 3 turns. Take 2 chips", "from the victim.", "Words are wind.", "Contracts are paper.", "Paper burns."]}, {"quad": 3, "page": 2, "text": ["FALSE FRIEND", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 3 | [A] 5 | [F] 4", "POWER: Look at an opponent's", "hand. Tell them you love them.", "Discard their highest card.", "They were only pretending", "to like your mixtape to get", "the nuclear codes.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 4}, {"page": 3, "n": 5, "text": ["PROPERLY PARANOID", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 6 | [A] 1 | [F] 1", "POWER: Check the bottom", "card of the deck. If it's a", "Trap, scream. Keep the", "card.", "It's not paranoia if the", "universe is actually out", "to get you.", "What"], "quad": 0}, {"quad": 1, "text": ["SPIES ARE DESPICABLE", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 4 | [A] 3 | [F] 2", "POWER: Look at the top", "3 cards of the deck. Put", "them back in the worst", "possible order.", "We hate them for lying.", "We pay them for the truth.", "We shoot them for receipt."], "page": 3, "n": 6}, {"text": ["FLU", "BETRAYAL INSURANCE", "Permanent Maughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 5 | [F] 4", "POWER: If a player steals", "from you, you may", "immediately steal two", "items from them.", "I knew you'd turn on me,", "so / poisoned your coffee", "three weeks ago."], "page": 3, "n": 7, "quad": 2}, {"quad": 3, "page": 3, "text": ["CHRONIC BACKSTABBING DISORDER", "Permanent Marghter", "[R] 2 | [A] 6 | [F] 5", "POWER: You MUST betray an", "ally this turn. If you have", "no ally, betray yourself", "(discard 2 cards).", "It's a compulsion. Like", "sneezing, but with more", "knives.", "GW Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 8}, {"page": 4, "text": ["THE STARSCREAM", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 4 | [A] 6 | [F] 6", "POWER: Challenge the", "current leader. If you lose,", "apologize profusely and", "draw 1 card.", "Standard operating", "procedure: Grovel to the", "face, plot against the back."], "n": 9, "quad": 0}, {"page": 4, "text": ["THE YES-MAN", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 2 | [A] 1 | [F]1", "POWER: Copy the action of", "the player to your right.", "Do it worse.", "I agree with whatever you", "Just said, sir, especially", "the part that contradicts", "what you said yesterday."], "quad": 1, "n": 10}, {"n": 11, "quad": 2, "page": 4, "text": ["STEALING THE CREDIT", "Permanent Maughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 4 | [F] 3", "POWER: Take a card", "someone else just played.", "Put it in your score pile.", "It's yours now.", "I made this.", "(I did not make this)."]}, {"n": 12, "page": 4, "quad": 3, "text": ["BASTARD UNDERSTUDY", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 3 | [A] 5 | [F] 2", "POWER: If a player is", "eliminated, take their", "seat and their hand.", "Break a leg. Seriously.", "I have a crowbar.", "KayfaB{GW", "/ Georg v. Westphalen"]}, {"n": 13, "page": 5, "text": ["HUMBUG!", "THE COUP", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 6 | [A] 6 | [F] 5", "POWER: Overthrow the", "player with the most", "points. Swap point", "totals with them.", "Look at me. I am the", "Captain now. Until the", "Lemurs get hungry."], "quad": 0}, {"n": 14, "page": 5, "quad": 1, "text": ["THE PUPPET MASTER", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 5 | [A] 2 | [F] 6", "POWER: Force another", "player to make a move", "of your choice.", "Dance, little fly. The web", "was never about", "catching you; it was about", "employment."]}, {"quad": 2, "text": ["I CAN RULE ALONE", "Permanent Maughter", "[R] 3 | [A] 6 | [F]4", "SC", "POWER: Break an alliance.", "Take all shared resources.", "Lose 1 turn because you", "are now lonely.", "The partnership is dissolved.", "Also, you are dissolved."], "n": 15, "page": 5}, {"page": 5, "quad": 3, "text": ["BOARD TO DEATH", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 4 | [F] 3", "POWER: Call a meeting.", "Everyone gives you", "1 card. If they refuse,", "they lose 1 life.", "This meeting could have", "been an email, but then I", "wouldn't get to eat you.", "Georg v. Westphalen", "GW"], "n": 16}, {"n": 17, "quad": 0, "page": 6, "text": ["THE MOLE", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 6 | [A] 3 | [F] 2", "POWER: Peek at", "everyone's hand.", "Reveal one card to the", "group.", "I'm not digging for worms.", "I'm oigging for dirt."]}, {"text": ["DOUBLE AGENT", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 5 | [F] 5", "POWER: Play a card on", "someone else's turn.", "It counts as their move,", "but you choose the target.", "I'm on your side.", "And his side.", "Mostly my side."], "page": 6, "quad": 1, "n": 18}, {"quad": 2, "text": ["THE STOOL PIGEON", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 2 | [F]1", "POWER: Name a card.", "If an opponent has it,", "they must discard it.", "sing like a bird. Specifically", "a bird who wants a plea deal."], "n": 19, "page": 6}, {"n": 20, "page": 6, "quad": 3, "text": ["DEAD PERSON IMPERSONATION", "Architects Daughter", "GRAVEYARD", "[R] 1 | [A] 6 | [F] 4", "POWER: Retrieve a card", "from the discard pile", "(the graveyard). Play", "WILL", "it immediately.", "Reports of my death were", "slan", "greatly exaggerated to", "collect the insurance money.", "KayfaB{GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"]}, {"n": 21, "quad": 0, "text": ["BETRAYAL BY OFFSPRING", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 6 | [A] 5 | [F] 2", "POWER: Give one of", "your bad cards to a", "player with more points", "(your \"parent\").", "Thanks for the food,", "Mom. Now get out of", "my room/nest/kingdom."], "page": 7}, {"page": 7, "n": 22, "quad": 1, "text": ["PARENTAL BETRAYAL", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 6 | [A] 6 | [F] 1", "POWER: Sacrifice a", "lower-value card to", "save a higher-value", "card.", "I brought you into", "this worldkendu out", "for a snack."]}, {"text": ["NOT ACTUALLY HIS CHILD •", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 4 | [F] 3", "Stay", "POWER: Reveal a secret.", "Force a player to swap", "their hand with the deck.", "He has your eyes. But he", "has the milkman's beak."], "n": 23, "quad": 2, "page": 7}, {"n": 24, "text": ["KINSLAYING", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 6 | [A] 6 | [F] 6", "Fluffy!", "POWER: Eliminate a", "player who belongs", "to the same 'faction'", "or 'suit' as you.", "It's a special kind of", "evil. The kind that", "saves on holiday gilts.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "page": 7, "quad": 3}, {"n": 25, "quad": 0, "page": 8, "text": ["LOVE-INTEREST TRAITOR", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 5 | [A] 5 | [F] 4", "POWER: If an opponent", "helps you, steal half", "their points next turn.", "Surprise! / was working", "for the Empire/Corporation/", "Ex-Boyfriend all along!"]}, {"page": 8, "text": ["THE HONEY TRAP", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 4 | [F] 5", "POWER: Force a plaver", "to attack you. Reflect", "the damage back", "to them.", "It's not love. It's", "bioluminescent predatory", "bait. Easý mistake."], "n": 26, "quad": 1}, {"page": 8, "quad": 2, "n": 27, "text": ["FAIR-WEATHER FRIEND", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 3 |[F]1", "POWER: Abandon an ally", "dain 2 pohts: they lose 2", "I'm with you", "until the end.", "Or until It gets", "slightly inconvenient.", "KayfaBONGO!"]}, {"page": 8, "quad": 3, "text": ["MISTAKEN FOR BETRAYAL", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 3 | [A] 1 | [F]2", "POWER: Play a card", "that looks like an", "attack but actually", "heals someone.", "I was trying to save you!", "Why are you hitting me", "with a newspaper?", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "n": 28}, {"text": ["uun", "Kayfa", "FACE-HEEL TURN", "[R] 4 | [A] 5 | [F] 5", "Power: Switch from \"Good® to", "\"Evil.\" All your healing cards", "become damage cards.", "Being a good boy was boring.", "I want to chew the furniture."], "page": 9, "quad": 0, "n": 29}, {"page": 9, "text": ["BIZARRO!", "HEEL-FACE TURN", "[R] 3 | [A] 4 | [F] 4"], "quad": 1, "n": 30}, {"text": ["GOING NATIVE", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 2 | [F] 6", "Power: Adopt the special", "ability of the player to your", "left.", "I find their culture superior.", "Also, the shrimp is better", "here."], "n": 31, "quad": 2, "page": 9}, {"text": ["THE QUISLING", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 6 | [A] 6 | [F] 1", "Power: Help an opponent win", "a challenge against your own", "team.", "I welcome our new", "insect-eating overlords.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 32, "quad": 3, "page": 9}, {"text": ["TROJAN HORSE", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 5 | [A] 6 | [F] 6", "POWER: Give a gift card to", "an opponent. When they", "flip it, they lose 3 cards.", "Beware of Greeks bearing", "gitts. Also beware of Mice", "bearing giant wooden Cats."], "quad": 0, "n": 33, "page": 10}, {"page": 10, "quad": 1, "text": ["LURED INTO A TRAP", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 6 | [A] 2 | [F] 1", "POWER: Play a high-value", "card face down. If someone", "attacks it, they are", "eliminated.", "Lore: It looked delicious.", "It tasted like a snapped spine."], "n": 34}, {"page": 10, "quad": 2, "n": 35, "text": ["FALSE INNOCENCE TRICK", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 3 | [A] 4 | [F] 3", "POWER: Negate an accusation.", "The accuser must apologize", "and discard a card.", "Lore: Who, me? I'm just a", "lil' guy. You wouldn't hit a", "lil' guy."]}, {"text": ["NASTY PARTY", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 5 | [F] 4", "SURVIVAL", "PARTY", "POWER: Invite all players to", "roll a die. Lowest roll is", "executed.", "BLÖDSINN!", "Lore: The Red Wedding was", "a bit much, but the catering", "was exquisite.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "page": 10, "n": 36, "quad": 3}, {"text": ["PRISONER'S DILEMMA", "Permanent Markter", "Snitch.", "[R] 6 | [A] 3 | [F]2", "Silent.", "POWER: Select an opponent.", "Both choose \"Snitch\" or", "\"Silent.\" Snitch/Silent =", "Snitch wins big. Both", "Snitch = Both lose.", "Lore: If I talk, I walk. If we", "both talk, we cook."], "page": 11, "quad": 0, "n": 37}, {"quad": 1, "text": ["I SURRENDER, SUCKERS!", "Permanent Marker", "[R] 4 | [A] 5 | [F]4", "POWER: Cancel combat.", "Then, immediately attack", "for double damage.", "Lore: White Tlag? No, that's", "just a napkin I'm using to", "wipe the floor with you."], "page": 11, "n": 38}, {"n": 39, "page": 11, "text": ["Kayfa", "RASH EQUILIBRIUM", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 3 | [A] 4 | [F] 3", "POWER: No one can attack", "anyone until your next turn.", "Lore: If I move, you shoot. If", "you shoot, he shoots. Let's", "just stand here and die of", "thirst."], "quad": 2}, {"text": ["BONGU:", "THE GAMBIT", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 6 | [F] 6", "POWER: Sacrifice your best", "card to automatically win the", "game in 3 turns (unless you", "die first).", "Lore: I lost the battle to win", "the war. And the parking", "space.", "GW", "Georg v Westphalen"], "page": 11, "quad": 3, "n": 40}, {"quad": 0, "page": 12, "text": ["THIRTY PIECES OF SILVER", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 6 | [A] 1 | [F]5", "POWER: Sell out an ally", "for 5 resource tokens.", "Lore: The price of loyalty", "is surprisingly affordable", "in this economy.", "Wha"], "n": 41}, {"text": ["POISONED CHALICE", "Architects Doughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 4 | [F] 3", "POWER: Offer a card to", "a player. If they accept,", "they die.", "Lore: A toast! To your", "health... or lack thereof.", "+ the"], "page": 12, "quad": 1, "n": 42}, {"quad": 2, "page": 12, "n": 43, "text": ["FLL", "LYING FINGER CROSS", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 2 | [A] 2 | [F] 1", "POWER: Retroactively", "cancel a deal you made", "last turn.", "Lore: It doesn't count if my", "digits were intertwined.", "International law."]}, {"page": 12, "n": 44, "text": ["JFF!.", "BURNER PHONE", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 5 | [A] 3 | [F] 2", "POWER: Contact a player", "secretly. Swap cards under", "the table.", "Lore: New number, who", "dis? Don't answer, I'm", "already gone.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "quad": 3}, {"page": 13, "quad": 0, "text": ["THE SCAPEGOAT", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 5 | [A] 3 | [F] 1", "POWER: Transfer all", "damage you take this turn", "to another player.", "Lore: It wasn't me! It was", "the guy with the horns!", "(Wait, I have horns)."], "n": 45}, {"quad": 1, "n": 46, "page": 13, "text": ["CANNON FODDER", "Permanent Marker", "[R] 6 | [A] 1 | [F]0", "POWER: Block an attack", "by discarding a", "iMinion' card.", "Lore: Their bravery is", "matched only by their", "expendability."]}, {"page": 13, "n": 47, "quad": 2, "text": ["SHOOT THE MESSENGER", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 4 | [F]2", "POWER: If someone plays", "a card you don't like,", "discard a card from their", "hand.", "Lore: Bad news is a", "capital offense."]}, {"quad": 3, "text": ["YOU HAVE OUTLIVED", "YOUR USEFULNESS", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 6 | [A] 6 | [F] 1", "GLUE", "POWER: Eliminate your", "own ally to gain their", "strength stats.", "EMPLOYEE", "Lore: The job is done.", "OF THE", "And so are you.", "MONTH", "GW Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 48, "page": 13}, {"n": 49, "page": 14, "quad": 0, "text": ["SIXTH RANGER TRAITOR", "Permanent Markter", "[R] 3 | [A] 5 | [F] 6", "POWER: Join a team.", "Betray them immediately", "for bonus points.", "Lore: Go Go Power", "Traitors! I was evil since", "the opening credits!"]}, {"n": 50, "page": 14, "text": ["EVIL ALL ALONG", "Architects Doughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 6 | [F] 5", "POWER: Reveal your true", "form. Discard your hand", "and draw 5 new cards.", "Lore: / wasn't shy. I was", "cocooning my rage."], "quad": 1}, {"quad": 2, "text": ["MANCHURIAN CANDIDATE", "Architects Daughter", "Kayfat", "[R] 5 | [A] 4 | [F] 3", "POWER: Activate a 'Sleeper'", "agent. Take control of", "another player's next turn.", "Lore: When you hear the", "word 'Omelette kill the", "Prime Minister."], "page": 14, "n": 51}, {"page": 14, "n": 52, "quad": 3, "text": ["THE CORRUPTIBLE", "SOGGLE!", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 2 | [F] 2", "POWER: If an opponent", "offers you a card, you", "must join their team.", "Lore: I have morals. But", "I also really like mud.", "GW", "Georg v Westphalen"]}, {"n": 53, "page": 15, "text": ["ET TU, BRUTE?", "Permanent Maxkter", "[R] 6 | [A] 6 | [F] 6", "POWER: If your best friend", "attacks you, they instantly", "win. You die of heartbreak.", "Lore: Then fall, Fido."], "quad": 0}, {"text": ["THE VENDETTA", "Architects Doughter", "1994", "[R] 5 | [A] 5 | [F] 2", "POWER: Target a player", "who hurt you 5 turns", "ago. Eliminate them.", "Lore: Elephants never", "forget. And we never", "forgive."], "quad": 1, "n": 54, "page": 15}, {"text": ["CURSE YOUR SUDDEN BUT INEVITABLE BETRAYAL!", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 4 | [A] 5 | [F] 6", "POWER: Play when someone", "betrays you. Shout the card", "title. Steal their shoes.", "Lore: We knew it was", "coming. We just hoped it", "would wait until after dessert."], "n": 55, "quad": 2, "page": 15}, {"n": 56, "quad": 3, "page": 15, "text": ["REGRETFUL TRAITOR", "Architects Daughter", "[R] 6 | [A] 1 | [F] 1", "POWER: Sacrifice yourself", "to save another player.", "(Redemption Arc).", "Lore: I won. But at what", "cost? Oh right, the cost", "was everyone else.", "SGW Georg v Westphalen"]}], "pdfPages": 15}